Detroit. First
Sergeant. and yeah.

20
00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:25.913
Well. then why don't
you quit your yapping

21
00:02:26.047 --> 00:02:27.815
and let's get these
resupplies to Schoenberg

22
00:02:27.949 --> 00:02:28.983
