[ENGINE WHIRS]

45
00:03:31.344 --> 00:03:32.914
Stop. stop. stop!

46
00:03:33.047 --> 00:03:34.716
Evans. it's not gonna work.

47
00:03:34.849 --> 00:03:36.751
-Fuck.
-[DISTANT EXPLOSION BOOMS]

48
