We're stuck. guys.

49
00:03:43.124 --> 00:03:44.224
Lancaster. help me
with this winch.

50
00:03:44.357 --> 00:03:45.526
SOLDIER:
What's going on. First Sergeant.

51
00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:47.762
LANCASTER:
On it. Top.

52
