Copy. copy. copy.
This is Derrick 06 actual.

1066
01:14:24.932 --> 01:14:27.168
RADIO OPERATOR:
<i>Derrick.</i>
<i>we've secured Elsenborn.</i>

1067
01:14:27.301 --> 01:14:29.170
