1136
01:18:54.001 --> 01:18:56.705
CASTLE:
Hey. do me a favor.

1137
01:18:56.837 --> 01:18:58.205
Tell the guys...

1138
01:18:58.339 --> 01:19:01.108
Tell the guys
to step on it. okay?

1139
01:19:01.242 --> 01:19:02.776
I'm in bad shape.

1140
01:19:02.910 --> 01:19:04.613
RADIO OPERATOR:
<i>Godspeed to you.</i>
<i>Captain Castle.</i>

1141
01:19:04.745 --> 01:19:05.879
<i>Out.</i>

1142
01:19:06.013 --> 01:19:07.248
Godspeed.

1143
